tes that vaccinated patients experienced self-limited illness\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Counts of doses by mode of administration might not sum to the total due to missing data from vaccines received out of jurisdiction.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"outcome_types\"]}", "type": "text"}]}